      "title": "Depends and the Mental Model",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 0,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Depends and the Mental Model",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. What Depends Does",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "A param `= Depends(fn)` is ==resolved before the handler runs==",
                "The callable's **return value** is passed in as the argument",
                "Any callable works: `def`, `async def`, or a class",
                "Its own params are parsed like path function params: path, query, header, body"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Request",
                    "sub": "arrives",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Call deps",
                    "sub": "FastAPI does it",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Handler",
                    "sub": "gets the values",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Response",
                    "sub": "sent back",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Sync vs Async Deps",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Dependency",
                "Runs on",
                "Catch"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`def`",
                  "threadpool",
                  "blocking is fine"
                ],
                [
                  "`async def`",
                  "event loop",
                  "a blocking call ==stalls the loop=="
                ],
                [
                  "Mixed",
                  "each in its own place",
                  "mixing is fine"
                ]
              ],
              "frame": "dashed"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Example and Mistakes",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "python",
              "lines": [
                "def common(q: str | None = None, limit: int = 10):",
                "    return {'q': q, 'limit': limit}",
                "",
                "@app.get('/items')",
                "def items(p: dict = Depends(common)):",
                "    return p"
              ],
              "note": "q and limit are read as query params of /items"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`Depends(get_db())` calls it at ==import time==",
                "It injects one fixed value, not a fresh one per request",
                "{green:Correct}: `Depends(get_db)`, the function uncalled"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Pass the function",
              "text": "Write `Depends(get_db)`, never `Depends(get_db())`. FastAPI does the calling."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Dependency Trees and Caching",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 1,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Dependency Trees and Caching",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Trees and the Typical Chain",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "A dependency can declare its own ==Depends(...)== params, which forms a **tree**",
                "FastAPI resolves the tree ==bottom-up==: leaves first, then the parents",
                "The endpoint declares only {green:require_admin}; the rest is pulled in"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "chain",
              "spec": {
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "text": "get_db",
                    "note": "leaf",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "get_current_user",
                    "note": "token + db",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "require_admin",
                    "note": "needs user",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "endpoint",
                    "note": "handler runs",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Per-Request Cache",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "Default",
                "use_cache=False"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Same dep declared twice",
                  "Runs ==once==, result shared",
                  "Runs **each time** declared"
                ],
                [
                  "Scope",
                  "One request",
                  "One request"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "python",
              "lines": [
                "fresh: int = Depends(counter, use_cache=False)"
              ],
              "note": "forces a new call at this declaration"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Annotated Alias",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "python",
              "lines": [
                "CurrentUser = Annotated[User, Depends(get_current_user)]",
                "",
                "@app.get('/me')",
                "def me(user: CurrentUser): ..."
              ],
              "note": "declare once, reuse in every handler"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Remember",
              "text": "In the tree, **get_db runs once** per request even if both get_current_user and the endpoint need it."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Yield Dependencies: Setup and Teardown",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 2,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Yield Dependencies: Setup and Teardown",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Setup, Value, Teardown",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Code ==before `yield`== is setup",
                "The **yielded value** is injected into the handler",
                "Code ==after `yield`== is teardown, run once the response is sent",
                "`finally` guarantees cleanup even when the handler raises"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "python",
              "lines": [
                "def get_db():",
                "    db = Session()  # setup",
                "    try:",
                "        yield db  # injected",
                "    finally:",
                "        db.close()  # teardown"
              ],
              "note": "standard pattern"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Teardown Order",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "chain",
              "spec": {
                "title": "Last set up, first torn down",
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "text": "a up",
                    "note": "setup",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "b up",
                    "note": "setup",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "b down",
                    "note": "teardown first",
                    "ink": "red"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "a down",
                    "note": "teardown last",
                    "ink": "red"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Errors and Sync vs Async",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Handler exceptions are ==re-raised at the yield==",
                "`except` there to ==rollback==, then `raise`",
                "{red:Cannot change the response} from teardown: it already started streaming"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "def + yield",
                "async def + yield"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Acts as",
                  "context manager",
                  "**async** context manager"
                ],
                [
                  "Runs in",
                  "threadpool",
                  "event loop"
                ],
                [
                  "Blocking call",
                  "fine",
                  "stalls the loop"
                ]
              ],
              "frame": "dashed"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "One yield only",
              "text": "Use ==one `yield`== per dependency: one setup, one value, one teardown."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Class Dependencies and Global Dependencies",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 3,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Class Dependencies and Global Dependencies",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Class Dependencies",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "A class is ==callable==: `Depends(Pagination)` calls `Pagination(...)`",
                "`__init__` params are read as ==query/path params==",
                "`Depends()` with no argument uses the ==type annotation== as the callable",
                "Wins over a dict for ==typed attributes== (`p.skip`) and editor autocomplete"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "python",
              "lines": [
                "class Pagination:",
                "    def __init__(self, skip: int = 0, limit: int = 10):",
                "        self.skip, self.limit = skip, limit",
                "",
                "@app.get('/items')",
                "def items(p: Pagination = Depends()):",
                "    return p.skip, p.limit"
              ],
              "note": "Depends() reads the annotation: Pagination"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Global Dependencies",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Level",
                "Syntax",
                "Covers"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Route",
                  "`@app.get('/x', dependencies=[Depends(verify_key)])`",
                  "that route"
                ],
                [
                  "Router",
                  "`APIRouter(dependencies=[Depends(auth)])`",
                  "every route in it"
                ],
                [
                  "App",
                  "`FastAPI(dependencies=[Depends(auth)])`",
                  "every route"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "App",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Router",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Route",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Parameters",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Return value is discarded",
              "text": "`dependencies=[...]` runs the dep but ==throws away== its result. Need the value? Declare it as a **parameter**."
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Interview Point",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Class over dict?** Typed attribute access and autocomplete",
                "**Does `dependencies=[...]` inject a value?** No, it only runs the dep",
                "**Execution order?** App, router, route, then parameters"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
